    "detailed_description": "<strong>MageCosmos is a creative VR community for those who look for diverse experience in a single game. Join us to discover more and more !</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/195a5b0048c70ce386abf0975b58c0f7.poster.avif?t=1686652122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/195a5b0048c70ce386abf0975b58c0f7.webm?t=1686652122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/195a5b0048c70ce386abf0975b58c0f7.mp4?t=1686652122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><i>Own An Island Here!</i></strong><br>MageCosmos is an open world where your adventures are unlimited. Your wonderful journey starts on a magical floating island with your own cozy house on it, like everybody else. Looking around, you will find neighbors living on the same island as you do. This is a HUGE world !<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/c4f717558624d4a7e0aeeff7a9452af4.poster.avif?t=1686652122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/c4f717558624d4a7e0aeeff7a9452af4.webm?t=1686652122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/c4f717558624d4a7e0aeeff7a9452af4.mp4?t=1686652122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><i>Farming In The Sky</i></strong><br>Your life on the island depends pretty much on how you manage it. You have a big farm to grow various plants, some animals to feed, everything on your island is your personal asset, investing time and watching your island flourish is pretty exciting. Oh by the way, don't forget to set up a shield before you leave or your farm can be &quot;robbed&quot; by friends and even strangers.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/c135798d76d0e85b8dafae8ad0030e17.poster.avif?t=1686652122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/c135798d76d0e85b8dafae8ad0030e17.webm?t=1686652122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/c135798d76d0e85b8dafae8ad0030e17.mp4?t=1686652122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><i>Friends With Neighbors</i></strong><br>Speaking of that, friends are important or it'll be so lonely in such an infinite world, shake hands with whoever you meet to become friends with and send gifts to them. You can also use a small rocket, fly around and explore the neighborhood on your own sometimes. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/ffb31ff639d5fc1fbc6a4a13616b40e9.poster.avif?t=1686652122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/ffb31ff639d5fc1fbc6a4a13616b40e9.webm?t=1686652122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/ffb31ff639d5fc1fbc6a4a13616b40e9.mp4?t=1686652122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><i>Games And Worlds</i></strong><br>As is implied in the name &quot;Cosmos&quot;, we are creating diverse styles of worlds to travel across, and party games for you and friends to play together...It's gonna be fun!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/4c6e81d841fc9686f0301556ebba36c0.poster.avif?t=1686652122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/4c6e81d841fc9686f0301556ebba36c0.webm?t=1686652122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/4c6e81d841fc9686f0301556ebba36c0.mp4?t=1686652122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>So what are you waiting for? Join the magical world of MageCosmos now and experience the ultimate social VR adventure!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>MageCosmos is a creative VR community for those who look for diverse experience in a single game. Join us to discover more and more !</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/195a5b0048c70ce386abf0975b58c0f7.poster.avif?t=1686652122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/195a5b0048c70ce386abf0975b58c0f7.webm?t=1686652122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/195a5b0048c70ce386abf0975b58c0f7.mp4?t=1686652122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><i>Own An Island Here!</i></strong><br>MageCosmos is an open world where your adventures are unlimited. Your wonderful journey starts on a magical floating island with your own cozy house on it, like everybody else. Looking around, you will find neighbors living on the same island as you do. This is a HUGE world !<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/c4f717558624d4a7e0aeeff7a9452af4.poster.avif?t=1686652122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/c4f717558624d4a7e0aeeff7a9452af4.webm?t=1686652122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/c4f717558624d4a7e0aeeff7a9452af4.mp4?t=1686652122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><i>Farming In The Sky</i></strong><br>Your life on the island depends pretty much on how you manage it. You have a big farm to grow various plants, some animals to feed, everything on your island is your personal asset, investing time and watching your island flourish is pretty exciting. Oh by the way, don't forget to set up a shield before you leave or your farm can be &quot;robbed&quot; by friends and even strangers.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/c135798d76d0e85b8dafae8ad0030e17.poster.avif?t=1686652122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/c135798d76d0e85b8dafae8ad0030e17.webm?t=1686652122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/c135798d76d0e85b8dafae8ad0030e17.mp4?t=1686652122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><i>Friends With Neighbors</i></strong><br>Speaking of that, friends are important or it'll be so lonely in such an infinite world, shake hands with whoever you meet to become friends with and send gifts to them. You can also use a small rocket, fly around and explore the neighborhood on your own sometimes. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/ffb31ff639d5fc1fbc6a4a13616b40e9.poster.avif?t=1686652122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/ffb31ff639d5fc1fbc6a4a13616b40e9.webm?t=1686652122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/ffb31ff639d5fc1fbc6a4a13616b40e9.mp4?t=1686652122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><i>Games And Worlds</i></strong><br>As is implied in the name &quot;Cosmos&quot;, we are creating diverse styles of worlds to travel across, and party games for you and friends to play together...It's gonna be fun!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/4c6e81d841fc9686f0301556ebba36c0.poster.avif?t=1686652122\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/4c6e81d841fc9686f0301556ebba36c0.webm?t=1686652122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617080/extras/4c6e81d841fc9686f0301556ebba36c0.mp4?t=1686652122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>So what are you waiting for? Join the magical world of MageCosmos now and experience the ultimate social VR adventure!",
